1
00:02:31,017 --> 00:02:39,057
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era, a countless array of pirates go to battle across

2
00:02:39,057 --> 00:02:44,677
the seas in search of the One Piece, the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the

3
00:02:44,677 --> 00:02:50,817
Pirates. Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit, set sail

4
00:02:50,817 --> 00:02:56,157
to become the next King of the Pirates. As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles, they

5
00:02:56,157 --> 00:03:01,197
capture the unwanted attention of the world government, which will use any means necessary

6
00:03:01,197 --> 00:03:08,717
to stop them. This is exciting! I can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

7
00:03:08,717 --> 00:03:15,337
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue, the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line

8
00:03:15,337 --> 00:03:24,037
to the New World. Separated from the rest of his crew, Luffy has finally arrived at Marineford

9
00:03:24,037 --> 00:03:30,657
to rescue his brother, Ace. In their attempt to save Ace, the Whitebeard Pirates have launched

10
00:03:30,657 --> 00:03:36,237
an all-out assault on any Marines standing in their way. And now, the battle is really starting

11
00:03:36,237 --> 00:03:44,637
to heat up. Now, come, come! Giant! Rise up!

12
00:03:44,637 --> 00:04:00,257
Hard battles, one after another. Devil fruit eaters versus devil fruit eaters.

13
00:04:00,257 --> 00:04:05,637
He toppled a giant all on his own! Hell yeah, Straw Hat! You took him down with one punch!

14
00:04:05,637 --> 00:04:12,257
Whoa! I'm back!

15
00:04:12,257 --> 00:04:16,257
Hey, Straw Hat! If you were aiming to get their attention, I think you've succeeded.

16
00:04:23,257 --> 00:04:29,097
Do not let the Foremost Group advance any further. Haul them off and put that rookie in the ground.

17
00:04:29,097 --> 00:04:33,717
Damn it! Make them pay!

18
00:04:33,717 --> 00:04:35,717
Aaaaaaah!

19
00:04:35,717 --> 00:04:36,717
Aaaaaaah!

20
00:04:42,717 --> 00:04:47,717
Enough beating around the bush. Let's launch a frontal attack and join Bob's inside the bay.

21
00:04:47,717 --> 00:04:49,717
Whatever it takes to save Ace.

22
00:04:49,717 --> 00:04:52,717
Drive them back with everything you've got!

23
00:04:52,717 --> 00:04:55,717
Aaaaaaah!

24
00:04:55,717 --> 00:05:10,337
We gotta fight the Vice-Admirals, too? Those guys are too strong!

25
00:05:10,337 --> 00:05:12,337
I don't think we have any other options.

26
00:05:12,337 --> 00:05:14,337
Well, this is gonna be rough, but do it for Ace!

27
00:05:14,337 --> 00:05:16,337
