28
00:05:16,337 --> 00:05:20,337
They're all going to get themselves killed!

29
00:05:20,337 --> 00:05:23,337
Bazooka unit ready! Now fire at Whitebeard!

30
00:05:23,337 --> 00:05:25,337
Look out!

31
00:05:25,337 --> 00:05:26,337
Look out!

32
