Aaaaaaah!

38
00:05:41,337 --> 00:05:42,337
Aaaaaaah!

39
00:05:42,337 --> 00:05:43,337
Now slash him to pieces!

40
00:05:43,337 --> 00:05:44,337
Aaaaaah!

41
00:05:44,337 --> 00:05:45,337
Aaaaaah!

42
00:05:45,337 --> 00:05:46,337
Aaaaaah!

43
00:05:46,337 --> 00:05:47,337
Aaaaaah!

44
00:05:47,337 --> 00:05:48,337
Aaaaaah!

45
00:05:48,337 --> 00:05:49,337
Aaaaaah!

46
00:05:49,337 --> 00:05:50,337
Aaaaaah!

47
00:05:50,337 --> 00:05:51,337
Aaaaaah!

48
00:05:51,337 --> 00:05:52,337
Aaaaaah!

49
00:05:52,337 --> 00:05:53,337
Aaaaaah!

50
00:05:53,337 --> 00:05:54,337
Aaaaaah!

51
00:05:54,337 --> 00:05:55,337
Aaaaaah!

52
00:05:55,337 --> 00:05:59,337
You're not gonna stop me from saving my brother, so you might as well get out of my way!

53
00:05:59,337 --> 00:06:03,337
Luffy, why do you care so much?

54
00:06:03,337 --> 00:06:06,337
Why do any of them care?

55
00:06:06,337 --> 00:06:08,337
I deserve to die like this.

56
00:06:08,337 --> 00:06:12,337
Why can't they see I'm not worth risking their lives for?

57
00:06:12,337 --> 00:06:13,337
Aaaaaah!

58
00:06:13,337 --> 00:06:14,337
Aaaaaah!

59
00:06:14,337 --> 00:06:15,337
Aaaaaah!

60
00:06:15,337 --> 00:06:16,337
Aaaaaah!

61
00:06:16,337 --> 00:06:17,337
Aaaaaah!

62
00:06:17,337 --> 00:06:21,337
We, the 2nd Division of the Whitebeard Pirates, will save our commander, Ace, no matter what

63
00:06:21,337 --> 00:06:22,337
the cost!

64
00:06:22,337 --> 00:06:23,337
Yes!

65
00:06:23,337 --> 00:06:25,337
Please don't do this.

66
