You can't be this stupid!

72
00:06:39,337 --> 00:06:40,337
Stop, Luffy!

73
00:06:40,337 --> 00:06:42,337
Turn around, Bobbs!

74
00:06:42,337 --> 00:06:43,337
Bobbs!

75
00:07:01,337 --> 00:07:03,337
