76
00:07:05,337 --> 00:07:06,337
I'm ready.

77
00:07:06,337 --> 00:07:13,337
Ready to accept whatever I deserve.

78
00:07:13,337 --> 00:07:16,337
I'll accept any help that's offered to me.

79
00:07:18,337 --> 00:07:21,337
But I'll also accept any punishment.

80
00:07:26,337 --> 00:07:28,337
Either one.

81
00:07:28,337 --> 00:07:30,337
Whichever comes first.

82
00:07:36,337 --> 00:07:47,337
I'm just ready for all this to end.

83
00:07:54,337 --> 00:07:55,337
On my signal, man!

84
00:07:56,337 --> 00:07:57,337
