88
00:08:12,337 --> 00:08:13,337
Look at that punk.

89
00:08:13,337 --> 00:08:15,337
It's like he's trying to steal the show.

90
00:08:15,337 --> 00:08:16,337
Like this is his war.

91
00:08:16,337 --> 00:08:18,337
It should be Captain Buggies.

92
00:08:18,337 --> 00:08:20,337
I think it's time, boss.

93
00:08:20,337 --> 00:08:23,337
You gotta stand up and show the world who you are.

94
00:08:23,337 --> 00:08:26,337
This is the perfect moment for you to defeat Whitebeard.

95
00:08:26,337 --> 00:08:27,337
Maybe I will.

96
00:08:27,337 --> 00:08:28,337
Maybe I will!

97
00:08:32,337 --> 00:08:33,337
I gotta keep stalling.

98
00:08:33,337 --> 00:08:35,337
This war is completely bonkers.

99
00:08:35,337 --> 00:08:38,337
There's nothing but monsters on both sides.

100
00:08:38,337 --> 00:08:41,337
I'll just keep my head down and stay quiet.

101
00:08:41,337 --> 00:08:42,337
Hey, you.

102
00:08:42,337 --> 00:08:43,337
Clown nose.

103
00:08:44,337 --> 00:08:46,337
What the hell did you just say to me?

104
00:08:46,337 --> 00:08:48,337
Are you cruising for a bruising punk?

105
00:08:49,337 --> 00:08:50,337
Huh?

106
00:08:53,337 --> 00:08:55,337
I take it back!

107
00:08:55,337 --> 00:08:57,337
I thought I recognized you.

108
00:08:57,337 --> 00:09:00,337
You worked for Roger back when you were just a brat.

109
00:09:00,337 --> 00:09:04,337
It's been a while, but it doesn't look like things have changed too much.

110
00:09:04,337 --> 00:09:06,337
I can't believe I just threatened him!

111
00:09:06,337 --> 00:09:07,337
He's gonna kill me!

112
00:09:08,337 --> 00:09:09,337
Yep, he's a dead man!

113
00:09:09,337 --> 00:09:11,337
His only chance is to run!

114
00:09:11,337 --> 00:09:13,337
Holy crap, it's Whitebeard!

115
00:09:13,337 --> 00:09:14,337
And he's speaking to him!

116
00:09:14,337 --> 00:09:17,337
That is like the coolest thing I've ever seen!

117
00:09:17,337 --> 00:09:20,337
It's just further proof that you are a genuine living legend!

118
00:09:20,337 --> 00:09:23,337
Don't they realize I'm about to die?

119
00:09:23,337 --> 00:09:26,337
Must be nice if it's not your ass on the line!

120
00:09:26,337 --> 00:09:29,337
You've got an entire battalion of prisoners.

121
00:09:29,337 --> 00:09:32,337
Now you're not planning on challenging me, are you?

122
00:09:32,337 --> 00:09:34,337
That right he is!

123
00:09:34,337 --> 00:09:37,337
Oh, sorry about that.

124
00:09:37,337 --> 00:09:39,337
You probably wanted to tell him yourself.

125
00:09:39,337 --> 00:09:42,337
You give him hell, Captain Buggy!

126
00:09:42,337 --> 00:09:45,337
I don't have much choice thanks to you morons!

127
00:09:45,337 --> 00:09:47,337
Yeah, we meet at last!

128
00:09:47,337 --> 00:09:49,337
Now prepare yourself!

129
00:09:52,337 --> 00:09:56,337
Geez, he is pushing his luck right off the edge of a cliff!

130
00:09:56,337 --> 00:09:57,337
Oh yeah?

131
00:09:57,337 --> 00:10:00,337
It doesn't bother me if you're hungry for a fight.

132
00:10:00,337 --> 00:10:02,337
But if you beat me, then what's next?

133
00:10:02,337 --> 00:10:06,337
Might be more navy soldiers than you can handle on your own.

134
00:10:06,337 --> 00:10:11,337
Oh hell, if I'm being honest, they're more than I can handle.

135
00:10:11,337 --> 00:10:14,337
Now I'm not one to back down from a challenge,

136
00:10:14,337 --> 00:10:17,337
but it would make more sense to form an alliance.

137
00:10:17,337 --> 00:10:20,337
Once we're done, then you can kick my ass.

138
00:10:20,337 --> 00:10:22,337
Oh holy crap!

139
00:10:22,337 --> 00:10:26,337
Whitebeard actually recognizes you as his brother in arms!

140
00:10:26,337 --> 00:10:28,337
He considers you an equal!

141
00:10:28,337 --> 00:10:31,337
No, he called him a brat like one minute ago!

142
00:10:31,337 --> 00:10:33,337
Don't tell me you're gonna try to take on the navy!

143
00:10:33,337 --> 00:10:35,337
You don't really think you can win, do you?

144
00:10:35,337 --> 00:10:37,337
Well, yeah.

145
00:10:37,337 --> 00:10:39,337
I've just gotta go all out!

146
00:10:39,337 --> 00:10:43,337
He's completely lost his grip on reality!

147
00:10:43,337 --> 00:10:44,337
Seriously?

148
00:10:44,337 --> 00:10:46,337
Oh, I've got goosebumps!

149
00:10:46,337 --> 00:10:47,337
You know what?

150
00:10:47,337 --> 00:10:48,337
Maybe I can do this!

151
00:10:48,337 --> 00:10:50,337
Maybe I really was destined to be king!

152
00:10:50,337 --> 00:10:52,337
Standing on top of the world!

153
00:10:54,337 --> 00:10:56,337
I think you might be onto something!

154
00:10:56,337 --> 00:10:58,337
Let's join forces and take down the navy!

155
00:10:58,337 --> 00:10:59,337
Ah!

156
00:10:59,337 --> 00:11:00,337
This is amazing!

157
00:11:00,337 --> 00:11:01,337
Man!

158
00:11:01,337 --> 00:11:02,337
It's too much!

159
00:11:02,337 --> 00:11:04,337
Alright, you win, Whitebeard!

160
00:11:04,337 --> 00:11:05,337
I'll partner with you!

161
00:11:05,337 --> 00:11:07,337
But only cause you're begging me to!

162
00:11:07,337 --> 00:11:08,337
Huh?

163
00:11:08,337 --> 00:11:09,337
So arrogant!

164
00:11:09,337 --> 00:11:10,337
Oh well!

165
00:11:10,337 --> 00:11:12,337
That's Captain Bunny!

166
00:11:12,337 --> 00:11:13,337
What's wrong with him?

167
00:11:13,337 --> 00:11:17,337
Did he pull some kind of brainwashing technique on these idiots?

168
00:11:17,337 --> 00:11:18,337
Think of these idiots!

169
00:11:18,337 --> 00:11:19,337
Hmm.

170
00:11:19,337 --> 00:11:23,337
Well, that guy is unbelievably easy to manipulate.

171
00:11:23,337 --> 00:11:25,337
He's a fool to say the least.

172
00:11:25,337 --> 00:11:28,337
But the prisoners he's got behind him are something else entirely.

173
00:11:28,337 --> 00:11:30,337
The last thing we need now is more enemies.

174
00:11:30,337 --> 00:11:37,337
Now, back to the war!

175
00:11:44,337 --> 00:11:45,337
All ships in the back!

176
00:11:45,337 --> 00:11:47,337
Come forward and deploy backup!

177
00:11:47,337 --> 00:11:49,337
It's time to show them what we're made of!

178
00:11:54,337 --> 00:11:55,337
I have a report, sir.

179
00:11:55,337 --> 00:11:59,337
All of the pirates stationed in the rear are currently heading this way!

180
00:11:59,337 --> 00:12:01,337
It took them long enough!

181
00:12:01,337 --> 00:12:03,337
Calling the forward unit at the bay head!

182
00:12:03,337 --> 00:12:05,337
Change the formation as the fleet admiral ordered!

183
00:12:05,337 --> 00:12:07,337
Prepare to deploy strategy!

184
00:12:07,337 --> 00:12:08,337
All units!

185
00:12:08,337 --> 00:12:09,337
Start backing up!

186
00:12:09,337 --> 00:12:10,337
But keep fighting!

187
00:12:10,337 --> 00:12:12,337
And make sure you retreat slowly!

188
00:12:14,337 --> 00:12:16,337
Did they stop firing on us?

189
00:12:16,337 --> 00:12:17,337
Yeah!

190
00:12:17,337 --> 00:12:18,337
It looks like they're starting to pull back!

191
00:12:18,337 --> 00:12:20,337
Those navy bastards are starting to buckle!

192
00:12:20,337 --> 00:12:22,337
One more push and we got them!

193
00:12:22,337 --> 00:12:24,337
Enemy ships on both sides!

194
00:12:24,337 --> 00:12:29,337
It's too late now!

195
00:12:29,337 --> 00:12:31,337
They can't stop us from charging the bay!

196
00:12:31,337 --> 00:12:32,337
Right!

197
00:12:32,337 --> 00:12:35,337
Now's our chance to finally join Pops at the center of the fight!

198
00:12:35,337 --> 00:12:36,337
Putta putta putta putta!

199
00:12:36,337 --> 00:12:37,337
Putta putta putta putta!

200
00:12:37,337 --> 00:12:38,337
Click!

201
00:12:38,337 --> 00:12:39,337
Come in!

202
00:12:39,337 --> 00:12:40,337
This is Whitebeard!

203
00:12:40,337 --> 00:12:42,337
Put Squard on the line, now!

204
00:12:42,337 --> 00:12:43,337
Oh!

205
00:12:43,337 --> 00:12:44,337
Pops!

206
00:12:44,337 --> 00:12:45,337
You need Captain Squard?

207
00:12:45,337 --> 00:12:46,337
Well he um...

208
00:12:46,337 --> 00:12:49,337
He was right here just a few moments ago but now uh...

209
00:12:49,337 --> 00:12:51,337
The thing is I'm not seeing him anywhere sir!

210
00:12:51,337 --> 00:12:52,337
Yeah go figure!

211
00:12:52,337 --> 00:12:56,337
All that tough talk and then he's not even around when you ask for his help!

212
00:12:56,337 --> 00:12:57,337
Hmm...

213
00:12:57,337 --> 00:12:59,337
Well so it goes!

214
00:12:59,337 --> 00:13:01,337
Get me the DeKalvin brothers then!

215
00:13:01,337 --> 00:13:02,337
Hey Pops!

216
00:13:02,337 --> 00:13:03,337
What's up?

217
00:13:03,337 --> 00:13:04,337
Yeah Pops!

218
00:13:04,337 --> 00:13:05,337
What's up?

219
00:13:05,337 --> 00:13:06,337
I want you to follow my lead!

220
00:13:06,337 --> 00:13:09,337
Take command of all pirate divisions around you!

221
00:13:09,337 --> 00:13:10,337
You got it!

222
00:13:10,337 --> 00:13:11,337
Yes sir!

223
00:13:11,337 --> 00:13:12,337
And what's the command?

224
00:13:12,337 --> 00:13:15,337
Just focus on sinking the approaching navy ships!

225
00:13:15,337 --> 00:13:16,337
What?

226
00:13:16,337 --> 00:13:17,337
But Pops!

227
00:13:17,337 --> 00:13:20,337
This is the best shot we've had at making a frontal assault since the battle got started!

228
00:13:20,337 --> 00:13:22,337
Yeah you're not giving up are ya?

229
00:13:22,337 --> 00:13:23,337
Just trust me on this one!

230
00:13:23,337 --> 00:13:26,337
I've got a bad feeling about those ships!

231
00:13:26,337 --> 00:13:28,337
Well you can count on us Pops!

232
00:13:28,337 --> 00:13:29,337
That's right!

233
00:13:29,337 --> 00:13:30,337
We got it!

234
00:13:30,337 --> 00:13:32,337
We'll spread the order to the other captain!

235
00:13:33,337 --> 00:13:34,337
Really?

236
00:13:34,337 --> 00:13:35,337
That straight from Pops?

237
00:13:35,337 --> 00:13:36,337
Well alright then!

238
00:13:36,337 --> 00:13:38,337
I can take the right side!

239
00:13:38,337 --> 00:13:39,337
I got it!

240
00:13:39,337 --> 00:13:40,337
We'll take the left side!

241
00:13:40,337 --> 00:13:41,337
Right!

242
00:13:41,337 --> 00:13:42,337
Understood!

243
00:13:42,337 --> 00:13:45,337
We'll join in on the right side too!

244
00:13:45,337 --> 00:13:46,337
Okay!

245
00:13:46,337 --> 00:13:48,337
If that's what Pops wants!

246
00:13:48,337 --> 00:13:50,337
My ship can take any direction!

247
00:13:50,337 --> 00:13:51,337
Whatever works best!

248
00:13:51,337 --> 00:13:53,337
Squad's missing?

249
00:13:53,337 --> 00:13:54,337
No!

250
00:13:54,337 --> 00:13:55,337
I haven't seen him lately!

251
00:13:55,337 --> 00:13:56,337
How unusual!

252
00:13:57,337 --> 00:13:58,337
Sure thing!

253
00:13:58,337 --> 00:13:59,337
We'll take the left flank!

254
00:14:01,337 --> 00:14:03,337
Excuse me fleet admiral sir!

255
00:14:03,337 --> 00:14:05,337
But the pirates of the new world have altered their battle tactics!

256
00:14:05,337 --> 00:14:06,337
Yes!

257
00:14:06,337 --> 00:14:08,337
It seems they've turned to the sides!

258
00:14:08,337 --> 00:14:11,337
They suddenly started attacking the approaching Navy ships!

259
00:14:11,337 --> 00:14:12,337
Your bluff's been called!

260
00:14:12,337 --> 00:14:13,337
Whitebeard must have sensed something's wrong!

261
00:14:13,337 --> 00:14:14,337
So I tried a cheap trick and he didn't fall for him!

262
00:14:14,337 --> 00:14:15,337
I'll admit it was a bit too obvious!

263
00:14:15,337 --> 00:14:22,337
But still he can't prevent the inevitable just because he sees it coming!

264
00:14:22,337 --> 00:14:27,337
You can't prevent the inevitable just because he sees it coming!

265
00:14:27,337 --> 00:14:43,337
CaptionCube

266
00:14:57,337 --> 00:15:06,697
Ah, damn it. There's too many of them. I don't see how we'll ever break through.

267
00:15:07,577 --> 00:15:08,257
Death!

268
00:15:08,617 --> 00:15:09,297
Wee-haw!

269
00:15:09,977 --> 00:15:11,257
Yee-haw!

270
00:15:12,157 --> 00:15:13,677
Whoa, Eva, you're all right!

271
00:15:14,597 --> 00:15:17,877
Eva, we've got to clear these jerks out to get to Ace!

272
00:15:18,297 --> 00:15:18,777
